  "scope_note": "检索截至2026-10-10 06:03（Asia/Shanghai），覆盖2026-10-03至10-09。常规检索已确认6条可由出版商元数据或正式页面日期证明处于过去24小时，高于5条阈值，未触发增强搜索；同时按常规要求检查专业期刊、综合出版平台、Crossref/PubMed与预印本、仪器厂商、会议培训、中国及海外采购，并完成全部方法主题簇检查。以全库51期421条和最近7期共同查重，在19条重点候选中排除2条日期超窗或仅为旧论文二次报道、2条原始内容不足、5条相关度较低或缺少新增技术信息的候选，最终收录10条，其中6条标注“近24小时”、4条标注“近7天扩展”。待复核标签：无。",
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-01",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 1,
      "title_cn": "80 MHz台式NMR联合机器学习监测1500 L CHO细胞培养",
      "direction_ids": ["nmr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["benchtop_nmr"],
      "method_ids": ["spectral_processing"],
      "application_ids": ["process_analysis", "pharma"],
      "sample_systems": ["8批1500 L CHO-K1细胞培养物", "曲妥珠单抗生物类似药生产过程样品"],
      "instrument_component_ids": ["software"],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Shi等以8批1500 L CHO-K1培养的128份样品比较80 MHz台式与600 MHz ¹H NMR，并用Lasso、Ridge、PLS和LightGBM预测36种代谢物、6种金属离子、活细胞密度、存活率及抗体滴度。按6批训练、2批测试后，80 MHz模型对抗体滴度的测试集R²为0.959，显示低场谱可用于生物制程的多指标监测。",
      "meaning_cn": "批次级留出测试比随机拆分更接近生产转移场景，但许多非NMR可见指标依赖培养过程中的相关关系。部署前应固定取样、温度、谱图预处理和内标条件，并在不同细胞株、培养基、批次及仪器上单独验证预测误差和漂移。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Journal of Pharmaceutical Innovation",
      "url": "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s12247-026-11120-w",
      "doi": "10.1007/s12247-026-11120-w",
      "alternative_sources": [],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
      "publication_status": "published",
      "tag_review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-02",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 2,
      "title_cn": "低场EDMR识别硅中⁷⁵As磁钟跃迁",
      "direction_ids": ["epr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["cw_epr"],
      "method_ids": ["defect_epr"],
      "application_ids": ["quantum_spin", "materials"],
      "sample_systems": ["近表面⁷⁵As掺杂²⁸Si", "Pb₀界面缺陷"],
      "instrument_component_ids": ["illumination"],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Acharya等在5 K、633 nm光照下，用低于10 mT的连续波电检测磁共振观察近表面⁷⁵As施主与Pb₀界面缺陷的自旋依赖复合，并在约3.8 mT、383 MHz附近识别磁钟跃迁。实验与模拟表明钟点附近场扫线宽反而增大，主要来自磁场与超精细场分布以及调制展宽，并不等同于相干性变差。",
      "meaning_cn": "在df/dB接近零的区域，场扫线宽不能直接换算为退相干时间。复现实验需同时记录频率扫结果、调制幅度、光功率、温度、同位素纯度和界面缺陷密度，并用完整自旋哈密顿量分离磁场、超精细与仪器展宽。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Physical Review Applied",
      "url": "https://journals.aps.org/prapplied/abstract/10.1103/6px2-hgr4",
      "doi": "10.1103/6px2-hgr4",
      "alternative_sources": [{"name": "arXiv预印本", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.24090"}],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
      "publication_status": "early_access",
      "tag_review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-03",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 3,
      "title_cn": "CW与脉冲EPR分开量化4H-SiC硅空位浓度及T₁/T₂",
      "direction_ids": ["epr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["cw_epr", "pulsed_epr"],
      "method_ids": ["defect_epr"],
      "application_ids": ["materials", "quantum_spin"],
      "sample_systems": ["4H-SiC中的V1和V2硅空位色心", "伴生X缺陷中心"],
      "instrument_component_ids": [],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Donà等用CW EPR定量4H-SiC中S=3/2的V1、V2及X缺陷，所得浓度分别为1.47×10¹⁴、5.6×10¹³和1.03×10¹³ spins/cm³，并在80–300 K以脉冲EPR比较中心跃迁与卫星跃迁。80 K时卫星跃迁的最长T₁为42.8 ms、T₂为0.708 ms，退相干主要受核自旋与电子自旋扩散限制。",
      "meaning_cn": "同一缺陷的中心与卫星跃迁具有不同弛豫通道，不能只用单一跃迁代表器件工作窗口。比较样品时应校准自旋计数，并固定温度、微波功率、脉冲选择性、缺陷浓度和辐照史；T₂归因还需结合核同位素组成及瞬时扩散控制。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Physical Review B",
      "url": "https://journals.aps.org/prb/abstract/10.1103/bg36-b6bs",
      "doi": "10.1103/bg36-b6bs",
      "alternative_sources": [],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
      "publication_status": "early_access",
      "tag_review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-04",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 4,
      "title_cn": "600 MHz ¹H NMR描绘冷藏鸡肉10天代谢轨迹",
      "direction_ids": ["nmr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["solution_nmr"],
      "method_ids": ["metabolomics"],
      "application_ids": ["food_agriculture", "quality_control"],
      "sample_systems": ["4 °C包装储藏的泰国本地鸡胸肉", "储藏1、3、5、7和10天样品"],
      "instrument_component_ids": [],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Phoemchalard等以600 MHz ¹H NMR跟踪4 °C包装鸡肉第1、3、5、7和10天的26种代谢物，并联用菌落、pH、滴水损失及常规品质指标。PCA和OPLS-DA将第10天样品分开，谷氨酰胺与N-甲基乙内酰脲被列为候选新鲜度标志物；大肠菌群也在第10天达到峰值。",
      "meaning_cn": "代谢谱可把微生物变化与感官前的化学变化放在同一时间轴，但候选标志物尚不能直接当作通用阈值。应用时需按鸡种、包装、温度波动和批次做外部验证，并报告OPLS-DA验证、含水量归一化、提取回收率和微生物检测误差。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Poultry",
      "url": "https://www.mdpi.com/2674-1164/5/5/70",
      "doi": "10.3390/poultry5050070",
      "alternative_sources": [],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
      "publication_status": "published",
      "tag_review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-05",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 5,
      "title_cn": "¹H NMR化学位移扰动补足氨基酸手性识别机制",
      "direction_ids": ["nmr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["solution_nmr"],
      "method_ids": [],
      "application_ids": ["chemical_structure"],
      "sample_systems": ["色氨酸、酪氨酸和苯丙氨酸对映体", "克林霉素磷酸酯手性选择剂"],
      "instrument_component_ids": [],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Khalid等以克林霉素磷酸酯作为毛细管电泳手性选择剂分离色氨酸、酪氨酸和苯丙氨酸对映体，并用分子对接与¹H NMR化学位移扰动解释识别作用。在含30%甲醇的硼酸盐体系中，酪氨酸谱峰展宽揭示动态结合，而单纯对接未能显示这一交换行为。",
      "meaning_cn": "该工作表明静态对接结果不足以说明溶液中的手性识别动力学，NMR可直接检查局部环境和交换。机制比较应分别对单一对映体做浓度或滴定序列，并固定pH、甲醇比例、温度和离子强度；峰展宽还需排除聚集及黏度效应。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Molecules",
      "url": "https://www.mdpi.com/1420-3049/31/20/3580",
      "doi": "10.3390/molecules31203580",
      "alternative_sources": [],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
      "publication_status": "published",
      "tag_review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "SF-20261010-06",
      "report_date": "2026-10-10",
      "item_no": 6,
      "title_cn": "钟跃迁模拟预测Er³⁺:CeO₂电子自旋秒级相干",
      "direction_ids": ["epr"],
      "experiment_type_ids": ["pulsed_epr"],
      "method_ids": ["cpmg"],
      "application_ids": ["quantum_spin", "materials"],
      "sample_systems": ["Er³⁺掺杂CeO₂", "¹⁷O核自旋浴"],
      "instrument_component_ids": [],
      "information_type": "paper",
      "summary_cn": "Mistri等用半经典模型与团簇关联展开计算Er³⁺:CeO₂钟跃迁处的电子自旋相干，纳入Er–Er偶极作用及¹⁷O核自旋浴。模型预测在10 ppb、10–20 mK时Hahn回波T₂可接近秒量级；在约2 K、10–100 ppb的较实际条件下约为10 ms，CPMG序列还能进一步延长相干。",
      "meaning_cn": "结果给出材料纯度、掺杂浓度与温度的定量设计区间，但目前属于理论预测。实验核对时应明确Er浓度、¹⁷O丰度、其他顺磁缺陷、脉冲误差和瞬时扩散，并分别报告Hahn与多脉冲结果，避免把理想序列计算直接视为器件相干时间。",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-09",
      "time_scope": "24h",
      "source": "Physical Review B",
      "url": "https://journals.aps.org/prb/abstract/10.1103/zb3k-h546",
      "doi": "10.1103/zb3k-h546",
      "alternative_sources": [{"name": "arXiv预印本", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.07332"}],
      "related_to": [],
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "first_seen": "2026-10-10",
      "last_updated": "2026-10-10",
      "report_file": "SpinFront_2026-10-10.html",
